# Regenerated by effect/build.sh. All twelve bundles inline the whole Effect library, so the
# directory is 2.5 MB of near-duplicate machine output. package-lock.json + build.sh make it
# reproducible byte for byte, which is why it is generated rather than committed.
#
# effect/fixtures/ is NOT ignored: exactly one bundle is committed there on purpose, as a
# large-real-input fixture. See README.md, "The one committed bundle".
effect/bundle/

# Symlink build.sh drops so esbuild can resolve `effect` from src/.
effect/src/node_modules

effect/node_modules/

# Installed by `npm ci` in server/packages/ for the s04 probe, which imports `fastify` by bare
# specifier on purpose (ADR 0027). 41 packages of machine output, reproducible from
# package-lock.json, so it is generated rather than committed - the same reasoning as
# effect/bundle/ above. A checkout without it skips s04 exactly as effect/ skips without bundles.
server/packages/node_modules/
